.vercel

# Visual parity artefacts.
# target/ and diffs/ are regenerable per-run, never committed.
# production/*.png (~400MB of baseline screenshots) regenerable via
#   `tsx tools/visual-parity/capture-production.ts --baseline-dir ./tests/visual-baseline`
# The manifest.json and per-route dom.json / capture.json ARE tracked
# (they're small and define what the gate covers).
tests/visual-baseline/target/
tests/visual-baseline/diffs/
tests/visual-baseline/production/**/*.png
